    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">What management should measure</div>
      <h2>Automation should improve a business outcome.</h2>
      <p>For accountants and CFOs, the case should be clear before the build starts.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="kpis">
      <div class="kpi"><b>Response time</b><span>How quickly enquiries or internal requests move to the next step.</span></div>
      <div class="kpi"><b>Cycle time</b><span>Time from enquiry to onboarding, or from work start to completion.</span></div>
      <div class="kpi"><b>Manual touches</b><span>How many manual actions a workflow removes from the team's week.</span></div>
      <div class="kpi"><b>Adoption</b><span>Whether staff consistently use the new process after launch.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

