      <div class="faq-list">
        <details open><summary>What is AI deployment for an accounting practice?</summary><p>It is the controlled implementation of AI and automation around a defined accounting-practice workflow. The scope should identify data, permissions, human approvals, exceptions and measurable outcomes before launch.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What should a practice automate first?</summary><p>Start with a frequent, rules-based process such as enquiry handling, appointment administration, onboarding or document follow-up, where the result is easy to measure.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Does AI make decisions on behalf of the firm?</summary><p>No. Automation handles repeatable steps, while professional advice, sensitive exceptions and client decisions stay under appropriate human control.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Does this replace Xero, MYOB or QuickBooks?</summary><p>No. AccrualOS and Sharktech Services sit around the operational layer. Exact integrations should be confirmed during scoping.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is AI deployment included in the AccrualOS fixed price?</summary><p>AccrualOS uses a fixed-price product model. Custom AI deployment work is separately scoped and quoted per job.</p></details>
